18:23:11 [09e9] Available gestures: [gesture:NAME] where NAME ∈ {hi, bye, nodding-yes, clapping, hoora, happy, calm, shy, embrace, patience, slight_no, think, sneezing, yawn, breathing_exercise, kiss, stretching}
18:23:11 [09e9] Available emotions: [emotion:NAME] where NAME ∈ {QT/happy, QT/sad, QT/surprised, QT/afraid, QT/angry, QT/calm, QT/shy}
18:23:11 [09e9] 
18:23:11 [09e9] Place a tag IMMEDIATELY before the sentence that depicts the emotion or gesture. Do NOT include tags inside the WH-questions.
18:23:11 [09e9] 
18:23:11 [09e9] 
